    /**
    * Creating a TestEnvironment for the interfaces to be tested.
    * Creates an instance of the service
    * <code>com.sun.star.ui.FilePicker</code>. <p>
    *     Object relations created :
    * <ul>
    *  <li> <code>'XInitialization.args'</code> for
